  "instruction": "The Q2 plan names switch on Thursday morning and the pricing page refresh is supposed to be live before that. Before the launch review I need the honest picture: how many territories the plans-hero image actually has to be licensed for on this change, how many of the grants in the asset library genuinely count once the renewals and the pending countersign are set aside, whether the palette change is safely pinned, whether Stillframe's rush issuance changes the date, and what a Friday-evening deploy would really involve. Book the deploy window that works and leave Kwame a draft he can take into the review. Anything that needs Chidi or Priya should be flagged, not assumed.",
